  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/uncrafted\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_229641.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252funcrafted\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/uncrafted?logo=modrinth&amp;label=&amp;suffix= &amp;style=flat&amp;color=242629&amp;labelColor=5ca424&amp;logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/uncrafted\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/229641(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Supported Versions\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/hmaD7Se\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&amp;logo=discord&amp;style=flat&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Uncrafted/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"400\"><br><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\">📖 模组介绍</h2><p>Uncrafted 是一个为原版已有物品和方块添加大量新合成配方的模组。通过本模组，你可以合成刷怪笼、基岩、生物蛋、命名牌等许多物品。</p><ul>\n<li>未添加任何新方块或物品，仅包含针对原版 Minecraft 的合成与熔炼配方</li>\n<li>目前包含 200+ 种新合成与熔炼配方！</li>\n<li>若需禁用某类配方，可使用预制数据包配合 /datapack 命令（例如 <code>/datapack enable \"mod/uncrafted/packs/no_admin_item_recipes\"</code> 可禁用命令方块配方）</li>\n<li>如需破坏已放置的基岩、命令方块等，推荐搭配使用我的另一款模组 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bedrock Miner</a>！</li>\n</ul><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>📷 效果展示</h2><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/6YmC1x0g.jpg\" alt=\"recipes\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;width:688px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/i93T-0Q2Nqc\" width=\"688\" height=\"417\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">注意：</span></strong>不同 Minecraft 版本存在配方差异，建议搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughitems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEI</a>、TMI 等配方查看模组使用！ :)</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>🗃️ 依赖项</h2><h3>必需组件：</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Magma Core</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>提供基础代码功能及更新检查器等特性</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magma-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmagma-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><h3>兼容组件：</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Just Enough Items (JEI)</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>提供额外信息页面并显示全部配方</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>🎮 我的其他模组</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Additional Structures\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bedrock Miner\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Tool Upgrades\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"All The Compatibility\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2291f5f13114f09294ce5e079f8a61b8a2617a8692e68ca453674e93f1982b62/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f427065525748442e706e67\" alt=\"Customized Dungeon Loot\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-sticks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AdvancedSticks/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Advanced Tools\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/age-of-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e8e1315b08a3bd1fb144ccd47488b1df4033418ad3aee01e61cc9d6e83fa55a5/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f586d324332576a2e706e67\" alt=\"Age of Weapons\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-craft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/RuneCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Rune Craft\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collectibles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Collectibles/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Collectibles\" width=\"85\"></a> <br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-gems\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExtraGems/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Extra Gems\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minetraps\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/MineTraps/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Mine Traps\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exo-craft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExoCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ExoCraft\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/city-craft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/CityCraft/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"City Craft\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upcycle\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Upcycle/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Upcycle\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Lexicon/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Lexicon\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nexus-battle-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Nexus/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Nexus\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-detective\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/BlockDetective/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Block Detective\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\